  "The June 2019 letter mentions $250,000 of coverage and names Maya Rao as primary beneficiary at that time. The 2024 family copy of a will names Priya for the estate. Those designations may apply to different assets.": "La carta de junio 2019 menciona $250,000 de cobertura y nombra a Maya Rao como beneficiario principal en ese momento. La copia de testamento de la familia 2024 nombra a Priya para el patrimonio. Esos nombramientos pueden aplicar a activos diferentes.",
  "The September 10 invoice shows $1,240. A September 14 receipt records a $400 payment. If applied to that invoice, $840 would remain, but the sample receipt does not establish that link.": "La factura September 10 muestra $1,240. Un comprobante September 14 registra un pago $400. Si se aplica a esa factura, quedaría $840, pero el comprobante de ejemplo no establece ese vínculo.",
